# systemd units the layer keeps enabled (and starts when it enables them):
# <package> <unit>...  Only for packages that are installed. A unit that was
# stopped by hand stays stopped; one that is disabled or has lost its enable
# links (e.g. another package of the same unit names was purged) is enabled
# again. A masked unit is left alone. ~/.config/dotfiles/apt/services.list adds
# more.
containerd.io containerd.service
docker-ce docker.socket docker.service
